"text": "`scripts/agent-run.sh` is the project's harness. This chunk has no boot path of its own and no live leg: the stand's boot is read by the stand checks inside `fast` and `stand-repeat`, so no smoke entry stands. The merge-shape probes 1–6 read the staged merge before the operator's commit, and entry 23 reads the committed parents. The legs follow CI's own list (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`): `build`, `msrv`, `fast`, `doc`, `a11y`, `audit`, `coverage`, `stand-repeat`, `counter` and `wasm` (architecture · contract/ci-leg-legs/counter; contract/ci-leg-legs/wasm). The adapter probe follows the lock move (a11y-plan history, the 2026-10-27 take). Entry 19 reads the sink-installing host under the package-alone build, which `fast`'s workspace build does not. Disk at the take-up: 520 GB free, `target/` 207 GB."
}
